        "answer": {
          "short": "$2(a+7)$",
          "worked": "Adding 7 gives $a+7$.\n$$\\begin{align*}(a+7)\\div\\frac12&=(a+7)\\times2\\\\(a+7)\\div\\frac12&=2(a+7)\\end{align*}$$",
